sequenceDiagram
    participant V as Viewer
    participant FE as AuthorCard
    participant API as API
    participant D as MongoDB
    participant P as Pipeline
    V->>FE: follow author
    FE->>API: POST /api/users/:id/follow
    API->>D: add edge on both docs
    API-->>FE: following=true, new count
    Note over V,P: next for-you request
    V->>P: GET /feed tab=for-you
    P->>D: hydrate context - following now includes author
    P->>D: in-network source queries author recent posts
    P-->>V: author content eligible and ranked
